{"game": "sniper-elite-resistance", "language": "english", "appid": 2169200, "month": "2025-04", "window": 2, "start_date": 1744070400, "end_date": 1744761599, "month_true_total": 127, "quota": 10, "returned": 10, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 09:03:38 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "192830162", "author": {"steamid": "76561198872353121", "personaname": "david_black", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198872353121/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 6829, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3673, "last_played": 1750517073, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Buy it if you absolutely must but never full price. \n\nThe same bugs from SE5 are still here. The same NPCs, the same difficulty. For example, when you invade two players, kill one, and the other leaves but then rejoins the same game, the invasion doesn’t end with your victory. Instead, the countdown goes into negative numbers indefinitely—until you kill again or die. This exact bug was already present in SE5.\n\nMany buildings are reused from SE5. Also, there are no scopes on SMGs anymore, which took away a lot of the fun from multiplayer and invasions.\n\nThe story feels like a waste of time—there’s nothing engaging or memorable about it. Some of the maps are decent, but I can’t think of a single one I’d actually want to replay over and over again.\n\nSE5: 588 hours played.\nSER: 25 hours (as of writing), and I really tried to prolong the experience and enjoy it. But there’s just nothing to enjoy. It feels more like a DLC for SE5 than a proper new game—clearly made with money in mind rather than gameplay.\n\nIf you're a fan of the series, start with SE V2 instead. The graphics are poor, but the plot used to be much better. The developers used to care about creating a good experience... until profits took over.\n\nKraken\n\n35 hours later update:\nThe game is fun for invasions only as not so many players from SE5, or they don't know the bugs, exploits etc. Campaign, multiplayer - boring if you play as intended.", "timestamp_created": 1744756383, "timestamp_updated": 1745241957, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.518518567085266113", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192830013", "author": {"steamid": "76561197969786013", "personaname": "LORDCORNPOP", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197969786013/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 7131, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 667, "last_played": 1776304813, "avatar": "23d13c18b053d72633970682ea6260b19158e489"}, "language": "english", "review": "nothing really new as far as game play, so if you played the last couple of sniper elite games you will not have to relearn anything which is nice, as far as the game its still entertaining to play.", "timestamp_created": 1744756196, "timestamp_updated": 1744756196, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192828689", "author": {"steamid": "76561199483599211", "personaname": "UnderGroundHound", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199483599211/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 94117, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3169, "playtime_at_review": 14758, "last_played": 1791506471, "avatar": "8442685651231b08503c282a75c5f324df2ae085"}, "language": "english", "review": "its the exact same game as sniper elite % with less maps", "timestamp_created": 1744754664, "timestamp_updated": 1744754664, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192826444", "author": {"steamid": "76561198012940430", "personaname": "LuKyno ツ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LUKYNOfyi/", "num_games_owned": 3415, "num_reviews": 77, "playtime_forever": 2563, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2263, "last_played": 1750281286, "avatar": "3d288a6c0e639a5d18426c213580c04648c73a54"}, "language": "english", "review": "We've seen this before, haven't we? But you know what, killing Nazis at a meter or five hundred in their faces (or balls) is still fun. Next time, though, it would be good to bring something fresh to the series, even though you're currently repeating yourself well", "timestamp_created": 1744752106, "timestamp_updated": 1744752106, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517241418361663818", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192815931", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970986839", "personaname": "SDKFZ222", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970986839/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 2029, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1132, "last_played": 1756640005, "avatar": "590bf7064ca41ffd5cbad79b5402d7150eb991f3"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1744741461, "timestamp_updated"